{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/15792", "id": 3036630788, "node_id": "PR_kwDOAEfiCM60_08E", "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/15792", "diff_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/15792.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/15792.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/15792", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/15792/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/15792/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/15792/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/statuses/8168ed0d57babb4d1d1d6c73e0f4091fcb098544", "number": 15792, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "Fix: Stabilize `ConfigCenterConfigTest` by Disabling Metrics Initialization and Ensuring Test Isolation    ", "user": {"login": "Anshul-creator", "id": 85193651, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg1MTkzNjUx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85193651?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator", "html_url": "https://github.com/Anshul-creator", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "## What is the purpose of the change?\r\n\r\nThis PR stabilizes several tests in `ConfigCenterConfigTest` that were intermittently failing under randomized execution orders (NonDex):\r\n\r\n- `testOverrideConfig2`\r\n- `testOverrideConfigBySystemProps`\r\n- `testOverrideConfigByDubboProps`\r\n- `testOverrideConfigBySystemPropsWithId`\r\n- `testOverrideConfigByDubboPropsWithId`\r\n\r\nAll of these tests trigger `DubboBootstrap.initialize()`, which unintentionally initializes the metrics subsystem. Since these tests do not depend on metrics, metrics initialization introduces nondeterministic failures unrelated to config-center logic.\r\n\r\n## Root Cause\r\n\r\nThese failures are identical to previously fixed issues in:\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/15778\r\n- https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/15782\r\n- https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/15785\r\n\r\nThose PRs addressed flakiness caused by Micrometer\u2019s `CompositeMeterRegistry` being initialized during `DubboBootstrap.initialize()`, which, under certain NonDex randomized execution orders, can throw an `ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException` from an internal `IdentityHashMap` iterator.\r\n\r\n`ConfigCenterConfigTest` suffers from the same root cause, and the same fix resolves the issue.\r\n\r\n## Changes Made\r\n\r\n- Disabled the metrics subsystem at the beginning of each test.\r\n- Cleared all system properties via `SysProps.clear()` in the lifecycle hooks to avoid cross-test pollution.\r\n- Reset framework state using `DubboBootstrap.reset()` to ensure isolation between tests.\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nYou can try running the following snippet of code from the dubbo repo root, on both pre-fix and post-fix code\r\n\r\n```bash\r\n./mvnw -q -pl dubbo-config/dubbo-config-api \\\r\n  edu.illinois:nondex-maven-plugin:2.2.1:nondex \\\r\n  -DnondexRuns=20\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe tests should fail intermittently on the pre-fix version, but pass consistently across all seeds on the post-fix version.\r\nNonDex run logs will be available under the `dubbo-config/dubbo-config-api/.nondex` directory.\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n- [x] Make sure there is a [GitHub_issue](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/issues) field for the change.\r\n- [x] Write a pull request description that is detailed enough to understand what the pull request does, how, and why.\r\n- [x] Write necessary unit-test to verify your logic correction. If the new feature or significant change is committed, please remember to add sample in [dubbo samples](https://github.com/apache/dubbo-samples) project.\r\n- [x] Make sure gitHub actions can pass. [Why the workflow is failing and how to fix it?](../CONTRIBUTING.md)\r\n", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:21:19Z", "updated_at": "2026-02-26T03:55:05Z", "closed_at": "2025-11-26T15:39:17Z", "merged_at": "2025-11-26T15:39:17Z", "merge_commit_sha": "9eee7c4b1ab0fde8b63632cc33fb83a457623d85", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "Anshul-creator:fix-ConfigCenterConfigTest", "ref": "fix-ConfigCenterConfigTest", "repo": {"id": 1076976850, "node_id": "R_kgDOQDFc0g", "name": "dubbo", "full_name": "Anshul-creator/dubbo", "owner": {"login": "Anshul-creator", "id": 85193651, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjg1MTkzNjUx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85193651?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator", "html_url": "https://github.com/Anshul-creator", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Anshul-creator/subscriptions